<title>USA: Somanetics proceeds to redeem warrants.</title>
<headline>Somanetics proceeds to redeem warrants.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Somanetics Corp said Thursday it is proceeding with the redemption of its 4,075,179 redeemable Class B warrants, effective November 14, for $0.05 per warrant.</p>
<p>The last day to exercise Class B warrants is November 13, 1700 EST.</p>
<p>Somanetics develops and manufactures a device that noninvasively monitors oxygen saturation changes in the brain's blood.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
